{"author":[{"collection_id":"Authors","document_content":{"avatar":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_50ac3cbb26fa4c21a9967e26675f94c5_/2325b688601478bc6278df9a9121ec4a232b1cf908495ead3ba795eb31c55ce687ff559c71c8ce02b27aec462fd4ec4c6cde8f11d872ae286f336f6eb65168be","height":974,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/ZaJP3AXmRdBneMpX_gzK6K-wqcR6xypjYskBCfk4edozBiOh9vJAPsXWbyzIN15gAShPrt_7RVCE9b374Yix26WwQnbwWx251CoNTFTb8fwlg16Yfos","width":974},"name":"Yasmine Evjen","title":"Senior Product Manager"},"document_id":6707371345444864,"document_label":null,"repo_id":"mio-example"}],"body_content":[{"code_snippet":[],"content":"<div style=\"text-align: center; position: relative; padding-bottom: 56.25%; max-width: 100%; height: 0;\"><iframe style=\"border-radius: 16px; position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/g5bcuxvJxX4\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe></div>\n<p>今天，我们正式上线 Material Design YouTube 频道！无论你是在为 Android、Flutter 还是 Web 进行开发，我们都有精彩的视频，教你更快地打造精美的产品。在 Material Live 系列中，跟随分步教程深入了解设计细节以及如何在代码中实现它们。全面了解我们的组件与设计原则，直接聆听构建这套系统的团队以及使用 Material Design 进行开发的团队的心声。我们会深入探讨你的设计与开发问题，例如：我的应用何时应该使用导航抽屉、底部导航栏，还是侧边导航栏？又该如何在我的&nbsp;UI 中应用颜色和字体排印？我们会在 <a href=\"https://twitter.com/hashtag/AskMaterial\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#AskMaterial</a> 系列中解答这些问题以及更多内容。欢迎关注 Material Design 频道，别忘了订阅，以便第一时间获取 Material Design 团队的最新动态。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p><a href=\"http://youtube.com/MaterialDesign?sub_confirmation=1\">订阅 Material Design 频道</a></p>","image":[],"related_links":[],"table":[],"video":[]}],"category":"2020","hero":{"a11y_description":null,"bordered":true,"caption":null,"case":null,"file":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_f3e8a4f639ce4c5aafa231fcb8daa630_/651d8567e294bd2c85eb02c4a790b00dcf4f5cc10a7578baea39372e85bb554ede312e042c16acfeff94b9cef9c3b48552cb0e38d66aa78f68d3610002d2441d","height":1440,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/A9cWdCGRd1bObEIXYa_exTvmaF8Jwmk